<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναρκ-άω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ήσω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			LXX
			<u>Da.</u>
			11.6
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grow
			stiff</i> or <i>numb</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεὶρ νάρκησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.328
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ψυχὴν καὶ τὸ στόμα ναρκῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					80b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς ναρκώσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					290
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἡσυχάζον ναρκᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ νεῦρον ὃ ἐνάρκησεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					32.32(33)
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεὶρ νεναρκηκυῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.8.5
				</span></i>
			; of the numbness caused by the fish <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρκη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620b19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				84b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναρκῶ, ναὶ τὸν Πᾶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					27.51
				</span></i>
			.</div>
